' A service by keys (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 0`: New
' Sandez). In the pub (`ServiceScene`, the inventory's navigation with the
' table as its second grid): Left lights the pack's first item, Space puts it
' on the table, Q is the service's own action — the drink paid for with it.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 60
mapclick 309,264         ' the pub
wait 120
press escape             ' its film (`ImageScene`) first
press left               ' the pack's first
press space              ' onto the table
wait 3
press q                  ' drink
wait 5
quit
